# Files whose change is a platform decision, not a task.
#
# A card never asks anyone to edit these. Ownership here is the machine reminding the
# reviewer, so a PR that touches one cannot be merged on the strength of a green gate
# alone — the gate checks that the code works, not that the decision was ours to make.
#
# Requires "Require review from Code Owners" on the branch protection rule for
# `development` and `main`, or this file is documentation rather than enforcement.

# The shared kernel. Every service depends on it, so a change here is a change to all 33.
/libs/platform-core/            @developer-sanyam

# The event and API contracts. Generated by `make openapi` — never hand-edited.
/libs/contracts/                @developer-sanyam

# Database roles and extensions. Runs once on a fresh volume; getting it wrong is a
# cross-tenant leak or an outbox that silently stops draining.
/tools/dev-bootstrap/init-db.sql    @developer-sanyam

# The eleven decisions that are expensive or impossible to reverse.
/docs/adr/                      @developer-sanyam

# What resolves a URL prefix to an upstream, and which product gates it.
/services/app-gateway/routes.json    @developer-sanyam
/services/admin-gateway/routes.json  @developer-sanyam
# The table the production gateway actually loads, and everything else that is production.
/infrastructure/edge/                @developer-sanyam

